# === main branch .gitignore (PUBLIC — GitHub Pages serves this) ===
# Reference-only / non-public directories
\.council/
\!Excluded/
**/\!Excluded/
.claude/

# Build "backend" — generators that produce the static output.
# Kept OUT of the public `main` branch; preserved on the private `backend` branch.
# (The GENERATED output in id/wiki/, en/wiki/, sitemap.xml DOES ship.)
generate-sitemap.js
tools/wiki-build/
build-wiki.bat
content/

# Agent instruction files (not part of the public site)
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# PGP private/secret key exports must stay local.
*private*.asc
*secret*.asc
*private*.gpg
*secret*.gpg
**.log
.playwright-mcp/*
